{"id":4214,"date":"2025-08-16T09:19:13","date_gmt":"2025-08-15T23:49:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?p=4214"},"modified":"2025-10-15T16:31:45","modified_gmt":"2025-10-15T07:01:45","slug":"product-type-google-shopping","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/","title":{"rendered":"Product Type Google Shopping: How to Optimize for Better ROAS"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"4214\" class=\"elementor elementor-4214\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dd1897f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"dd1897f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0aa8b72 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0aa8b72\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-487f49e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"487f49e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you sell on Google Shopping, your &#8220;<strong>product type Google Shopping&#8221;<\/strong> setting in Merchant Center can make or break your campaigns. Understanding how to structure and optimize your product type Google Shopping field is key to improving targeting, lowering CPCs, and boosting ROAS.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8c1bb18 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8c1bb18\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Product Type  Organizes Your Feed<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-51ea906 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"51ea906\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">This hierarchy organizes your feed and supports better campaign segmentation and keyword targeting. For more details, you can review <a href=\"https:\/\/support.google.com\/merchants\/answer\/6324406\">Google\u2019s Merchant Center documentation on product type<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-261deeb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"261deeb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Product type in Google Shopping is a label you define in Merchant Center to categorize your products. Unlike Google\u2019s predefined product categories, product type is fully customizable, giving you flexibility to organize your feed according to your business needs.<\/p><p>For example: <em>Clothing &gt; Women\u2019s Clothing &gt; Dresses &gt; Maxi Dresses<\/em><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-25b494c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"25b494c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Product Type Google Shopping Matters for Ad Performance<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e0ab57 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5e0ab57\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A well-structured product type hierarchy improves campaign segmentation, helping you allocate budgets strategically. Broad levels (1\u20132) group similar products for top-level targeting, while deeper levels (3+) capture high-intent searches with long-tail keywords. This approach often leads to lower CPCs and increased ROAS.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f351eb3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f351eb3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c07d795 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c07d795\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-501a7e5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"501a7e5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px\">Campaign Segmentation Benefits of Product Types <\/span><\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-16d2f09 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"16d2f09\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Broad product types, such as Clothing &gt; Women\u2019s Clothing, make it easier to group similar items, manage budgets, and measure performance. You can build separate campaigns for each top-level type, ensuring spend goes where it delivers the most returns.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e77479 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6e77479\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0134e3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e0134e3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Campaign-Segmentation-Benefits_-Product-Type-Google-Shopping--300x300.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-5298\" alt=\"Campaign-Segmentation-Benefits_- Product Type Google Shopping\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Campaign-Segmentation-Benefits_-Product-Type-Google-Shopping--300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Campaign-Segmentation-Benefits_-Product-Type-Google-Shopping--150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Campaign-Segmentation-Benefits_-Product-Type-Google-Shopping-.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6552bc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d6552bc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-30ecf8c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"30ecf8c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8f9dc08 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"8f9dc08\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Long-Tail-Keyword-Benefits-of-Product-Types-google-shopping--rawtxf5kck83unsgua1518w81d6rjkk88z0w3qpwu4.png\" title=\"Long-Tail Keyword Benefits of Product Types google shopping\" alt=\"Long-Tail Keyword Benefits of Product Types google shopping\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c785e6e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c785e6e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ef205c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ef205c1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Long-Tail Keyword Benefits of Product Types <\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ba4210 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5ba4210\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Detailed product types, such as Clothing &gt; Women\u2019s Clothing &gt; Dresses &gt; Maxi Dresses &gt; Summer Maxi Dresses, help capture searches like:<\/p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">\u201cSummer maxi dresses under $50\u201d<\/span><\/li><li>\u201cFormal women\u2019s dresses with lace details\u201d<\/li><\/ul><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">These searches tend to have high purchase intent, which means higher conversion rates and better ROAS.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f6c80a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6f6c80a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Product Type Google Shopping vs. Product Categories<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d806a22 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d806a22\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>It\u2019s common to confuse product type with Google\u2019s product categories. Here\u2019s the difference:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Product Categories:<\/strong> Predefined by Google, mandatory for certain verticals.<\/li><li><strong>Product Types:<\/strong> Defined by you, giving flexibility to align your feed structure with your advertising goals.<\/li><\/ul><p>Both matter, but product type gives you the control to tailor segmentation and keyword targeting.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e708a3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6e708a3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e873a48 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e873a48\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eeafe4d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"eeafe4d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><span style=\"font-size: 22.4px\">Common Mistakes to Avoid<\/span><\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5e1866b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5e1866b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul data-spread=\"false\" data-pm-slice=\"3 3 []\"><li><p><strong>Generic Labels<\/strong>: Using vague terms like \u201cProducts\u201d or \u201cSale\u201d doesn\u2019t help Google understand your items.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>Overcomplication<\/strong>: Creating overly long, inconsistent hierarchies makes feeds harder to manage.<\/p><\/li><li><p><strong>Leaving It Blank<\/strong>: Not setting a product type is a missed opportunity for better targeting and campaign performance.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e27313 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2e27313\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23a966d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"23a966d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/elementor\/thumbs\/Common-Mistakes-to-Avoid_-with-product-types-in-Google-1-rawuld3kfn01l30g14m11pdwrp6cm0m37h956h7wcc.png\" title=\"Common-Mistakes-to-Avoid_-with-product-types-in Google (1)\" alt=\"Common-Mistakes-to-Avoid_-with-product-types-in Google (1)\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a042e68 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a042e68\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fe05a9f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fe05a9f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How to Optimize Product Type Google Shopping<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6da7d17 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6da7d17\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li>Use Consistent Formatting: Start broad, then go specific.<\/li><li>Levels 1\u20133 for Segmentation: Keep these focused for budget control and reporting.<\/li><li>Levels 4+ for Long-Tail Keywords: Use deeper levels to target seasonal, niche, and attribute-specific searches.<\/li><li>Prioritize High-Value Products: Apply optimization first to best-sellers or seasonal products.<\/li><\/ol><p>Leverage AI Tools: <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/platform\/\">Platforms like FeedOps<\/a> can automate product type suggestions, fix inconsistencies, and save time.<\/p><p>Read our <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/guide\/google-shopping-feed-management\/\">Google Shopping Feed Optimization<\/a> guide\u00a0<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">to learn more about structuring and optimizing your feed for maximum ROAS.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f3cc99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7f3cc99\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Advanced Strategies for Product Type Google Shopping<\/span><\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d5ce52 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6d5ce52\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li><strong>Seasonal Adjustments:<\/strong> Modify deeper product types to align with trends, e.g., \u201cWinter Coats &gt; Down Jackets.\u201d<\/li><li><strong>Attribute-Based Targeting:<\/strong> Include material, style, or price in deeper levels for more precise targeting.<\/li><li><strong>A\/B Testing:<\/strong> Test different product type structures to see which drives better performance.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5f5dbdb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5f5dbdb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Final Thoughts<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a16d7fc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a16d7fc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Mastering the product type Google Shopping setting ensures your campaigns are well-structured, relevant, and profitable. A thoughtful hierarchy supports better ad targeting, improves click-through rates, and maximizes ROAS. If you\u2019re unsure where to start, begin with a free feed audit to identify gaps and opportunities in your current setup.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d45fbc elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3d45fbc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Check these demo<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1759ef3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1759ef3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/demo\/automate-product-types-with-feed-rules\/\">Automating Product Types with Feed Rules<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/demo\/enhance-product-categorization-with-feedops-ai\/\">Enhancing Product Types with FeedOps AI<\/a><\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/demo\/edit-product-types-using-the-bulk-editor\/\">Manually Adding Product Types to Your Feed<\/a><\/li><\/ul><div>\u00a0<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b1a31c8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b1a31c8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>You may also find this video useful: <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/video\/why-product-types-in-google-and-microsoft-matter\/\">Why Product Types in Google and Microsoft Matter.<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><h3 data-start=\"6195\" data-end=\"6350\">Free Guides (no email required)<\/h3><ul><li data-start=\"6195\" data-end=\"6350\">For more Optimization Techniques see <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/guide\/google-shopping-feed-optimization-guide\/\">Google Shopping Feed Optimization Guide<\/a><\/li><li data-start=\"6195\" data-end=\"6350\">To learn more about Feed Management, See &#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/guide\/google-shopping-feed-management\/\">Google Shopping Feed Management Guide<\/a>\u00a0<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b3a56e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4b3a56e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FAQ: Product Type Google Shopping<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c0c9fa7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion\" data-id=\"c0c9fa7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;expanded&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"nested-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-n-accordion\" aria-label=\"Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2020\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" open>\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2020\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What is the difference between product type and product category in Google Shopping? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-2020\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-af9d770 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"af9d770\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b2b36eb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b2b36eb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Product categories are predefined by Google and ensure your listings are classified correctly for compliance and eligibility in specific verticals, like Apparel or Electronics. Product types, however, are entirely custom, giving you the flexibility to structure your feed in a way that aligns with your campaign strategy, keyword targeting, and merchandising goals.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2021\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2021\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> How many levels should my product type hierarchy have? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-2021\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6f78bc0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6f78bc0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-778eb04 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"778eb04\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Most businesses benefit from using Levels 1\u20133 for campaign segmentation and budget allocation, as they provide clear organizational structure. Levels 4 and beyond are best for targeting niche audiences through long-tail keywords, allowing you to capture highly specific, purchase-ready traffic.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2022\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2022\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Can product type Google Shopping improve ROAS? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-2022\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-943b64a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"943b64a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ddd603 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2ddd603\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Absolutely. By organizing your products into relevant, detailed hierarchies, Google can match your ads with more qualified search queries. This relevance often leads to lower CPCs, higher CTRs, and better conversion rates\u2014resulting in a stronger ROAS.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2023\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2023\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Should I update product types for seasonal trends? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-2023\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d30fab0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d30fab0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f79fc50 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f79fc50\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Yes. Updating your product types to reflect seasonal changes\u2014such as adding \u201cWinter,\u201d \u201cHoliday,\u201d or \u201cBack to School\u201d at deeper levels\u2014helps you target shoppers looking for timely products and can increase click-through rates during peak buying periods.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2024\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"5\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2024\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Can AI help with product type optimization? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-2024\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c8e3282 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c8e3282\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a061cb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4a061cb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Yes. AI tools like <a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\">FeedOps<\/a> can analyze your catalog, detect missing or inconsistent product types, and suggest optimized hierarchies based on keyword trends and competitive data. This saves time, ensures accuracy, and keeps your campaigns aligned with market demand.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>If you sell on Google Shopping, your &#8220;product type Google Shopping&#8221; setting in Merchant Center can make or break your campaigns. Understanding how to structure and optimize your product type Google Shopping field is key to improving targeting, lowering CPCs, and boosting ROAS. Product Type Organizes Your Feed This hierarchy organizes your feed and supports [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9,"featured_media":4399,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[141],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4214","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-google-shopping-feed"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Product Type Google Shopping: How to Optimize for Better ROAS<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Product Type Google Shopping: How optimizing product types enhances the performance of shopping ads. Discover strategies to boost ROAS\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Product Type Google Shopping: How to Optimize for Better ROAS\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Product Type Google Shopping: How optimizing product types enhances the performance of shopping ads. Discover strategies to boost ROAS\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-08-15T23:49:13+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-10-15T07:01:45+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/why-product-types-matter.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"628\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Frank Grasso\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Frank Grasso\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"5 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"Frank Grasso\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/935d648bb8def3c2afc809a576755608\"},\"headline\":\"Product Type Google Shopping: How to Optimize for Better ROAS\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-08-15T23:49:13+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-10-15T07:01:45+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/\"},\"wordCount\":1112,\"commentCount\":0,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/why-product-types-matter.png\",\"articleSection\":[\"Google Shopping Feed\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"CommentAction\",\"name\":\"Comment\",\"target\":[\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/#respond\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/\",\"name\":\"Product Type Google Shopping: How to Optimize for Better ROAS\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/why-product-types-matter.png\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-08-15T23:49:13+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-10-15T07:01:45+00:00\",\"description\":\"Product Type Google Shopping: How optimizing product types enhances the performance of shopping ads. Discover strategies to boost ROAS\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/#primaryimage\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/why-product-types-matter.png\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/why-product-types-matter.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":628,\"caption\":\"product type google shopping matters\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-type-google-shopping\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Product Type Google Shopping: How to Optimize for Better ROAS\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\",\"name\":\"FeedOps\",\"description\":\"\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#organization\",\"name\":\"FeedOps\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Feedops-staggered-logo_Final-2-e1653522818889.png\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/Feedops-staggered-logo_Final-2-e1653522818889.png\",\"width\":899,\"height\":929,\"caption\":\"FeedOps\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\",\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/company\/feedops\/\",\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@feedops\"]},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/935d648bb8def3c2afc809a576755608\",\"name\":\"Frank Grasso\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#\/schema\/person\/image\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/10729b10d31fe46be449737d0a25a76598f7994e4b44a67056563d0715c3fa71?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/10729b10d31fe46be449737d0a25a76598f7994e4b44a67056563d0715c3fa71?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"caption\":\"Frank Grasso\"},\"description\":\"I\u2019ve managed over $700 million in ad spend, contributing to billions in revenue. I say \\\"contributing\\\" because online success hinges on three key factors: a product people want, a price they\u2019re willing to pay, and timely delivery. The rest is about attention to detail. I'm not your typical digital advertising expert. My background is unconventional. I left school at 14 and worked as a mechanic until I was 33. In 2002, I leveraged my problem-solving skills to launch a $1 million Google Ads campaign for a travel client. This experience taught me how to optimize ad quality and campaign structure to reduce costs. Over time, I witnessed Google\u2019s evolution: from Sponsored Links to AdWords, then Shopping Ads, Smart Shopping, and finally PMax. As Google expanded its digital media dominance, I realized that my agency needed to adapt. That\u2019s when I shifted focus and sold my agency to start FeedOps. At FeedOps, my mission is to help eCommerce businesses sell more products, increase revenue, and reduce ad spend. We focus on relevance, the core of effective digital advertising. By ensuring your product data and ads are highly relevant to user intent, we help you spend less and gain more. Relevance drives everything from higher click-through rates to better conversion rates and lower costs. At FeedOps, we harness this principle to optimize your ads and product data, ensuring you achieve better returns on your advertising investments. My mission is to help advertisers scale their creativity and productivity, and to provide them with the best tools and solutions to reach their target audiences and achieve their goals. I am passionate about leveraging the latest technologies and trends to enhance the capabilities and performance of our software, and to deliver exceptional value and service to our clients. I am also committed to building and nurturing a talented and diverse team of digital marketers and software developers, who share my vision and values of excellence, collaboration, and customer satisfaction.\",\"sameAs\":[\"http:\/\/www.feedops.com\"],\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/author\/frank-grasso\/\"}]}<\/script>\n<!-- \